WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.783
This one is for mum and dad.

00:00:01.783 --> 00:00:06.686
The parent view shows today's plan and tomorrow's, so you do not have to ask.

00:00:06.686 --> 00:00:10.633
You can set the level of support: Operator, Co pilot or Pilot.

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:15.536
That controls how much the app plans for him, and you can change it any time.

00:00:15.536 --> 00:00:20.630
The school feed brings in homework and key dates, and the calendar fills itself.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.559
Dates that need confirming are listed for you.

00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:26.361
Alerts reach you when something new arrives.

00:00:26.361 --> 00:00:30.627
To check in without nagging, ask questions rather than give orders.

00:00:30.627 --> 00:00:33.365
What would you change about tonight's plan?

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:36.230
Which block are you looking forward to least?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.987
What would make it easier? Then step back. The plan is his.

00:00:39.987 --> 00:00:43.807
Try it now: open the parent view and set the level together.

